{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Paracosm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>(noun)</i></strong> <strong>A detailed imaginary world...</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DOWNWARD SPIRAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as an ex ballerina, whose  career ending injury leaves her trapped and isolated. Is she simply taking time away recovering in her room, or is she TRAPPED WITH HER WORST CRITIC? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pink Creepy <i>MICRO GAME</i> Descent</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time go on, things get darker. She escapes her trauma by diving into her imaginary world.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect deceptively <i>cute</i>, fast paced, <i>micro games</i> laced with psychological horror...kinda like WarioWare but<i> pink\u00a0.\ud81a\udd54 \u0741 \u02d6   \u2726    \u2027\u208a\u02da \u22c5</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every <i>micro game</i> features <i>cute</i>, vibrant and slightly twisted artwork- a perfect glimpse into our favourite ballerina's mind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strut through her room, uncover trinkets that reveal more about her former self</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each <i>micro game</i> is simple to play, multitasking is a must as the games progress</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HELP HER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY THROUGH HER MEMORIES, HOPES AND DEEPEST FEARS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BASK IN THE TRADITIONALLY ANIMATED MICRO SCENES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will she succumb to her demonic inner world? Only you can decide in this mire of micro games.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044530?t=1761157478","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044530?t=1761157478","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.s